{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd9d\u00a0<strong>Game Features\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udd9d</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Collecting &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Every resource bounces, rolls, and stacks with satisfying chaos as you build, craft, and manage your growing raccoon economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Helping Pals</strong> \u2013 From balloon carriers to over-eager workers, your raccoon friends each have their own quirks and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious Sidekick</strong> \u2013 Feely isn\u2019t just a companion, they\u2019re your link to the missing King, and maybe something stranger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Vector-Style Graphics</strong> \u2013 Clean shapes, bold outlines, and cozy colors make the world feel hand-built by mischievous raccoon paws.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of Secrets</strong> \u2013 Hidden jokes, strange events, and collectible surprises reward the curious (and the raccoons who can\u2019t stop digging).</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814730?t=1766766146","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/10210e39cacee52334743f0dc6fe0e443a7afe7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766766146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/648efd47f2a29c7a3b1e87b341db8707eb05e362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766766146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/648efd47f2a29c7a3b1e87b341db8707eb05e362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766766146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Upcoming In Full Release</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Resources, More Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo shows only 1/4 of the total resources and upgrade paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/03d28ed1d881704928443b48a843c2bc.poster.avif?t=1766766146\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/03d28ed1d881704928443b48a843c2bc.webm?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/03d28ed1d881704928443b48a843c2bc.mp4?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine resources to craft decorations and curiosities that bring your village to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/5cdb83295cfdff53375bbb1dbc410033.poster.avif?t=1766766146\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/5cdb83295cfdff53375bbb1dbc410033.webm?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/5cdb83295cfdff53375bbb1dbc410033.mp4?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helping Pals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new raccoon companions, including a balloon helper that can carry resources across the valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/48843d11dae2c77128470d33dc82bc91.poster.avif?t=1766766146\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/48843d11dae2c77128470d33dc82bc91.webm?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/48843d11dae2c77128470d33dc82bc91.mp4?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your raccoons with hats and tools. Every villager becomes their own little character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/bff95b545cdbe2b1803e10b9885f853b.poster.avif?t=1766766146\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/bff95b545cdbe2b1803e10b9885f853b.webm?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/bff95b545cdbe2b1803e10b9885f853b.mp4?t=1766766146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd9d\u00a0<strong>Game Features\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udd9d</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Collecting &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Every resource bounces, rolls, and stacks with satisfying chaos as you build, craft, and manage your growing raccoon economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Helping Pals</strong> \u2013 From balloon carriers to over-eager workers, your raccoon friends each have their own quirks and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious Sidekick</strong> \u2013 Feely isn\u2019t just a companion, they\u2019re your link to the missing King, and maybe something stranger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Vector-Style Graphics</strong> \u2013 Clean shapes, bold outlines, and cozy colors make the world feel hand-built by mischievous raccoon paws.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of Secrets</strong> \u2013 Hidden jokes, strange events, and collectible surprises reward the curious (and the raccoons who can\u2019t stop digging).</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dumivid"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/7ee81d09785ef8d1b43c909cd4e8c0810847d980/header.jpg?t=1766766146","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814730/372086245/8d73bab06e461e8043fd68f5559e82c9c98c2fa5/1760204195/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760208826","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814730/372086245/8d73bab06e461e8043fd68f5559e82c9c98c2fa5/1760204195/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760208826","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814730/372086245/8d73bab06e461e8043fd68f5559e82c9c98c2fa5/1760204195/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760208826","id":257216153,"name":"Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216153/4f40a78f13fe8dc639c55bcc2d8bc9c9d9abe489/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760208826"}],"name":"Raccoon Valley Tycoon","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dumi